# Verification Walkthrough - Holistic Expansion Sprint

## 1. Shared Components (`src/components/shared`)

### ✅ LotusPetalFAB
- **Verification**: Check if the FAB appears in the bottom right.
- **Animation**: Does it "breathe" (gently scale up and down)?
- **Interaction**: Does it provide haptic feedback on press?
- **Visual**: Is the Lotus bloom image clearly visible with a glow effect?

### ✅ SanctuaryCard
- **verification**: Check cards in Library and Community feeds.
- **Animation**: Does the card "lift" slightly when pressed?
- **Visual**: Confirm the "Midnight Blue" background and rounded corners.

## 2. Library Feature ([src/screens/LibraryScreen.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/screens/LibraryScreen.tsx))

### ✅ Resource Feed
- **Initial State**: Verify mock data loads (PDF, Video, Doc).
- **Search**: Type in the search bar. Do results filter dynamically?
- **Empty State**: Clear the list (mock test) -> Does the [EmptyState](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/components/shared/EmptyState.tsx#16-73) component appear with the "BookOpen" icon?

### ✅ Add Resource Flow
- **Trigger**: Tap the [LotusPetalFAB](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/components/shared/LotusPetalFAB.tsx#30-117).
- **Modal**: Does the [AddResourceModal](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/components/library/AddResourceModal.tsx#13-94) slide up?
- **Input**: Enter a title and URL.
- **Action**: Tap "Add Resource". Does the new item appear at the top of the list?

## 3. Community Feature ([src/screens/CommunityScreen.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/screens/CommunityScreen.tsx))

### ✅ Tab Navigation
- **Switching**: Tap "Groups" -> Does the view change to Group List? Tap "Feed" -> Back to Posts?
- **Active State**: Does the active tab button highlight in "Sanctuary Saffron"?

### ✅ Feed & Posts
- **PostCard**: Verify different types (Announcement vs Post).
- **Anonymous**: Check the "Silent Student" post. Is the avatar generic and name "Anonymous"?
- **Badges**: Does the "Announcement" post have an orange badge?

### ✅ Groups
- **GroupCard**: Verify icons match type (Staff=Lock, Class=Users, Public=Globe).
- **Meta**: Check member counts and descriptions.

